---
description: UniBestia UI polish rules
globs:
  - "apps/web/**/*"
  - "apps/business-web/**/*"
  - "packages/ui/**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

You are working on the UniBestia project.

Important constraints:
- Do not touch apps/mobile.
- Do not remove or disable R2.
- Do not remove or disable Clerk.
- Do not remove or disable Redis.
- Do not rewrite backend business logic unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer small, safe, reviewable changes.
- Use TypeScript strictly.
- Keep the existing Turborepo architecture.

UI brand:
- Background: #F7F6F1
- Main text: #17384B
- Accent: #FF9F8A
- Use rounded-[28px] / rounded-[32px]
- Use soft shadows
- Use pastel SaaS style
- Use responsive layouts
- Use accessible buttons and loading states.

For UI polish tasks:
- Prefer reusable components in packages/ui.
- Add skeleton loaders instead of plain loading text.
- Add ButtonLoader for async buttons.
- Add PageTransition for major pages.
- Add AnimatedCard for cards.
- Add EmptyState for empty lists.
- Add StatusBadge for statuses.
- Do not change tRPC procedure names or backend API contracts.